VER CORP SAYS ON OCT 4, CO ENTERED INTO A $1 BILLION FIVE-YEAR UNSECURED REVOLVING CREDIT FACILITY', 'text': "DOVER CORP -  ON OCT 4, CO ENTERED INTO A $1 BILLION FIVE-YEAR UNSECURED REVOLVING CREDIT FACILITY WITH A SYNDICATE OF THIRTEEN BANKS.DOVER - COMMITMENTS OF LENDERS UNDER CREDIT AGREEMENT MAY BE INCREASED BY ADDITIONAL AMOUNT OF UP TO $500 MILLION DURING TERM OF CREDIT AGREEMENT.DOVER - CREDIT AGREEMENT REPLACES EXISTING $1 BILLION FIVE-YEAR UNSECURED CREDIT FACILITY PURSUANT TO A CREDIT AGREEMENT DATED NOVEMBER 10, 2015.DOVER CORP - LENDERS' COMMITMENTS UNDER CREDIT AGREEMENT WILL TERMINATE ON OCT 4, 2024."}{'symbol': 'DOW', 'date': '2019-10-10 22:30:00', 'title': 'DOW ANNOUNCES FULL REDEMPTION OF ALL OUTSTANDING 4.125% NOTES DUE 2021', 'text': 'DOW INC. ANNOUNCED A FULL REDEMPTION OF ITS 4.125% NOTES DUE 2021 ISSUED PURSUANT TO AN INDENTURE DATED AS OF MAY 1, 2008 BETWEEN TDCC AND THE BANK OF NEW YORK MELLON TRUST COMPANY, N.A., AS TRUSTEE. AS OF THE DATE OF ISSUANCE OF THE REDEMPTION NOTICE, THERE WAS $1,250,000,000 AGGREGATE PRINCIPAL AMOUNT OF SUCH NOTES OUTSTANDING. PURSUANT TO THE TERMS OF THE INDENTURE, SUCH REMAINING OUTSTANDING NOTES WILL BE REDEEMED IN FULL ON NOVEMBER 12, 2019 AT A REDEMPTION PRICE EQUAL TO THE GREATER OF (1) 100% OF THE PRINCIPAL AMOUNT THEREOF, AND (2) THE SUM OF THE PRESENT VALUES OF THE REMAINING SCHEDULED PAYMENTS OF PRINCIPAL AND INTEREST THEREON (NOT INCLUDING ANY PORTION OF SUCH INTEREST PAYMENTS ACCRUED AS OF THE REDEMPTION DATE), DISCOUNTED TO THE REDEMPTION DATE ON A SEMIANNUAL BASIS (ASSUMING A 360-DAY YEAR CONSISTING OF TWELVE 30-DAY MONTHS) AT THE TREASURY RATE (AS DEFINED IN THE NOTES AND DETERMINED ON THE THIRD BUSINESS DAY PRIOR TO THE REDEMPTION DATE) PLUS 35 BASIS POINTS, AS SET FORTH IN THE NOTES, ALONG WITH ACCRUED AND UNPAID INTEREST UP TO, BUT NOT INCLUDING, THE REDEMPTION DATE. ON THE REDEMPTION DATE AND UPON TDCC’S PAYMENT OF THE REDEMPTION PRICE, ALL RIGHTS OF HOLDERS WITH RESPECT TO THE NOTES BEING REDEEMED WILL TERMINATE, EXCEPT FOR THE RIGHT TO RECEIVE PAYMENT OF THE APPLICABLE REDEMPTION PRICE UPON SURRENDER OF THE NOTES FOR REDEMPTION.'}{'symbol': 'DOW', 'date': '2019-10-10 19:30:00', 'title': 'DOW DECLARES QUARTERLY DIVIDEND OF 70 CENTS PER SHARE', 'text': 'DOW DECLARES QUARTERLY DIVIDEND OF 70 CENTS PER SHARE.'}{'symbol': 'DD', 'date': '2019-10-10 08:30:00', 'title': 'DUPONT DECLARES REGULAR QUARTERLY DIVIDEND ON COMMON STOCK', 'text': 'DUPONT DECLARES REGULAR QUARTERLY DIVIDEND ON COMMON STOCK.DUPONT - DECLARED A Q4 DIVIDEND OF $0.30 PER SHARE.'}{'symbol': 'DXC', 'date': '2019-10-10 22:30:00', 'title': 'DXC TECHNOLOGY COMPANY DECLARES REGULAR QUARTERLY DIVIDEND FOR THE QUARTER ENDING SEPTEMBER 30, 2019, PAYABLE ON JANUARY 14, 2020', 'text': "THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS OF DXC TECHNOLOGY DECLARED A REGULAR QUARTERLY DIVIDEND PAYMENT FOR THE QUARTER ENDING SEPTEMBER 30, 2019 OF $0.21 PER SHARE ON THE COMPANY'S COMMON STOCK. THE DIVIDEND WILL BE PAID ON JANUARY 14, 2020 TO STOCKHOLDERS OF RECORD AT THE CLOSE OF BUSINESS ON DECEMBER 4, 2019."}{'symbol': 'EW', 'date': '2019-10-10 18:30:00', 'title': 'CINDE ANNOUNCES EDWARDS LIFESCIENCES INVESTS $100 MLN TO EXPAND IN COSTA RICA', 'text': 'CINDE ANNOUNCES EDWARDS LIFESCIENCES INVESTS $100 MILLION TO EXPAND ITS OPERATIONS IN COSTA RICA.'}{'symbol': 'EQR', 'date': '2019-10-10 22:30:00', 'title': 'THE DINERSTEIN CO., INC. AND HARRISON STREET REAL ESTATE CAPITAL, LLC ACQUIRED BERKELEY APARTMENT PORTFOLIO FROM EQUITY RESIDENTIAL (NYSE:EQR).', 'text': 'THE DINERSTEIN CO., INC. AND HARRISON STREET REAL ESTATE CAPITAL, LLC ACQUIRED BERKELEY APARTMENT PORTFOLIO FROM EQUITY RESIDENTIAL (NYSE:EQR) ON OCTOBER 11, 2019. THE PORTFOLIO CONSISTS OF STERLING ADDISON, STERLING ALLSTON, STERLING HASTE , STERLING JEFFERSON, STERLING OXFORD, STERLING UNIVERSITY AVE. THE PORTFOLIO IS REBRANDED AS STERLING BERKELEY COLLECTION AND WILL BECOME A COMPONENT OF STERLING HOUSING, THE STUDENT HOUSING DIVISION OF THE DINERSTEIN CO., INC.  JOSEPH SMO